  {"t":"mc","s":"Which is FALSE","q":"Which of the following statements is FALSE?","o":["The Council of Trent rejected the Protestant view of “Scripture alone”","Immaculate Conception – Mary was conceived without sin (free of original sin)","Calvin led the Reformation in Geneva, Switzerland","The five points of Calvinism are often symbolized by the mnemonic device TULIP","All of the above statements (A–D) are TRUE"],"a":4,"why":"None of A–D is false; each statement is taken from the study guide.","k":"q9e7c059c"}
